# Menu

## Rules

- The menu must have two states: open and closed.
- Open menu: display the icons and labels.
- Closed menu: collapse the menu into a vertical bar showing only the icons of all options.
- Use a vertical sidebar with a blue background matching the primary color of the design system.
- Use white text and icons.
- The active item must be visually distinguished by a slightly lighter background.
- Use slightly rounded corners for the navigation items.
- See `components/layout/side-nav.tsx`.